               "text": "Texto Original",
               "page": "https://www.historytracers.org/index.html?page=class_content&arg=9d4c7f85-0e69-4795-a738-0acb54f2011d",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2024",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Órdenes\n\nLa primera relación de las familias con los números está en el orden de los números.\n\n¿Es posible que un hijo nazca antes que sus padres?",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "d50b202e-78b9-4c78-8cfa-ea64eafebf2a",
         "prev": "",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": "no",
         "score": 1
      },
      {
         "id": "d50b202e-78b9-4c78-8cfa-ea64eafebf2a",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "inlove",
         "source_menu": [
